title: APC NetBotz: Enclosures
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment
license: GPLv2
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 This check monitors the enclosures of APC NetBotz appliances via SNMP
 (NetBotz50-MIB, enclosureTable): the appliance itself, sensor pods,
 probes and wireless coordinators. The details show serial number, parent
 enclosure and, where available, model, hardware revision and firmware.

 The service is {OK} if the enclosure status is normal and {CRIT} if it is
 disconnected or in error. An error status of the enclosure adds {WARN}
 (warning) or {CRIT} (error, critical, failure). The appliance enclosure
 also evaluates the global NetBotz error status the same way.

item:
 The enclosure id as reported by the device.

discovery:
 One service is created for each enclosure.
